msgstr "Quant al Myrlyn"

#: about-dialog.ui:52
msgid "## Myrlyn "
msgstr "## Myrlyn "

#: about-dialog.ui:81
msgid ""
"Myrlyn is a graphical package manager to select\n"
"software packages and patterns for installation,\n"
"update and removal.\n"
"\n"
"It uses libzypp as its backend and Qt as its\n"
"GUI toolkit.\n"
"\n"
"This started in the 11/2024 SUSE Hack Week\n"
"to make the SUSE YaST Qt package selector usable\n"
"as a standalone Qt program without any YaST\n"
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"El Myrlyn és un gestor de paquets gràfic per seleccionar\n"
"paquets i patrons de programari per a la instal·lació,\n"
"actualització i supressió.\n"
"\n"
"Usa libzypp com a fons i Qt com a\n"
"joc d'eines de la IGU.\n"
"\n"
"Això va començar a la 11/2024 SUSE Hack Week\n"
"per fer usable el selector de paquets SUSE YaST Qt\n"
"com a programa Qt independent sense cap\n"
"dependència del YaST."

#: about-dialog.ui:123
msgid ""
"### Main Author\n"
"\n"
"Stefan Hundhammer (GitHub: @shundhammer)\n"
"\n"
"### Contributors\n"
"\n"
"- Christoph Grüninger (GitHub: @gruenich)\n"
